      "id": "kpk1-l15-e2-t01",
      "before": "kpk1-l15-e2-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "Szukam jej"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Szukać* takes the genitive, and a verb that takes the accusative takes the genitive after *nie*: *szukam go* (I'm looking for him, or for it), *szukam jej*, *szukam ich*; *nie widzę go*, *nie widzę jej*. *Jego* is the stressed *go*: *nie lubię ani jej, ani jego* (I like neither her nor him). *Nie ma go* is he isn't here."
      }
    }
  ],
